IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0021.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> DEPOSIT TERM IN MONTHS
    05 DEPOSIT-TERM       PIC 9(3).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 APPLIED-RATE       PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM SET-TERM-RATE
    DISPLAY "APPLIED-RATE=" APPLIED-RATE
    STOP RUN.
SET-TERM-RATE.
    EVALUATE DEPOSIT-TERM
        *> SHORT TERM DEPOSIT RATE
        WHEN 1 THRU 6
            MOVE 0.0300 TO APPLIED-RATE
        *> MEDIUM TERM DEPOSIT RATE
        WHEN 7 THRU 18
            MOVE 0.0375 TO APPLIED-RATE
        WHEN 19 THRU 60
            MOVE 0.0450 TO APPLIED-RATE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.0200 TO APPLIED-RATE
    END-EVALUATE.
